# - `push i; push 0|1; call 0x004ea970` (pops 0: a getter), `mov ecx,eax; call 0x00ba30f0 / 0x00ba3130` (each `ret 8`):
#   the two words are the second call's arguments;
# - `push 0; call 0x004dc310; push eax; push core; call 0x004e3270` (pops 0), `push eax; call 0x00874b90` (`ret 0x10`):
#   0x00874b90 takes the getter's result and the three words pushed before it;
# - `push x; call 0x004a0ea0` (pops 0), `mov ecx,eax; call 0x00b6da10` (`ret 4`), twice;
# - `push 1|0; push 0x1e|0x9d; call 0x007fdf30` (pops 0), `mov ecx,eax; call 0x00a24660 / 0x00a24180` (`ret 8`).
